<title>USA: CTC Communications Q4 net flat.</title>
<headline>CTC Communications Q4 net flat.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>				     Mar 31, 1997    Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p>   Total Revenue		   11,471,782	 7,448,332</p>
<p>   Net income			 1,280,917	 1,281,174</p>
<p> Earnings per share			0.12		0.12</p>
<p> Weighted shares outstanding   10,605,106	10,883,647</p>
<p>					    12 Months Ended</p>
<p>				     Mar 31, 1997    Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p>   Total Revenue		   40,290,099	30,875,925</p>
<p>   Net income			 4,682,931	 4,093,924</p>
<p> Earnings per share			0.43		0.38</p>
<p> Weighted shares outstanding   10,789,980	10,727,641</p>
<p>NOT: Earnings per share and weighted shares outstanding for the periods indicated above reflect the 3-for-2 stock split declared on July 13, 1995, and the 2-for-1 stock split declared on Oct. 10, 1995.</p>
</text>
